The fact that it's not working suggests that either the `dependencyManagement` in my root POM isn't correctly picking up the versions from `spring-boot-starter-parent:3.2.5`, or perhaps the `secure-multimodule-springboot-java21` parent that the sub-modules use is somehow interfering or overriding the inherited `dependencyManagement`.

