My initial strategy, which is standard Maven practice, was to put `spring-boot-starter-parent` in the root `pom.xml` and then have all sub-modules inherit from that root `pom.xml`. The fact that this *isn't* working right now makes me think the issue might be deeper – perhaps an environmental problem or a configuration issue that's not immediately obvious in the `pom.xml` files themselves.

