for `task-web`.

Therefore, I've decided to pivot my approach. Instead of relying solely on the 
transitive `dependencyManagement` provided by `spring-boot-starter-parent`, I 
will explicitly import the `spring-boot-dependencies` BOM directly into the 
`dependencyManagement` section of the *root* `pom.xml`. I will ensure this is 
placed correctly, avoiding any potential conflicts. This is the standard and 
robust method for managing dependency versions in a multi-module project, 
especially when aiming for centralized version control.

