simply wasn't published under that exact combination.

To confirm, I decided to directly consult Maven Central. Upon visiting the 
provided URL, I found that the POM file *does* indeed exist at that location for
version `3.2.5`. This discrepancy immediately pointed towards an issue with my 
earlier `curl` command, or possibly a caching problem on the remote end, or even
